graph TB
    Start([客户端发起请求]) --> CheckPath{检查请求路径}
    
    CheckPath -->|登录/注册等公开接口| AllowAccess[直接放行 anon]
    CheckPath -->|需要认证的接口| FilterChain[进入Shiro过滤器链]
    
    FilterChain --> OAuth2Filter[OAuth2Filter拦截]
    
    OAuth2Filter --> IsOptions{是否OPTIONS请求?}
    IsOptions -->|是| CORSReturn[返回CORS头,直接放行]
    IsOptions -->|否| GetToken[从Header/Param获取Token]
    
    GetToken --> TokenEmpty{Token是否为空?}
    TokenEmpty -->|是| Return401_1[返回401: 无效的令牌]
    TokenEmpty -->|否| ClearThreadLocal[清除ThreadLocal旧Token]
    
    ClearThreadLocal --> VerifyJWT[验证JWT Token]
    
    VerifyJWT --> JWTValid{JWT是否有效?}
    
    JWTValid -->|有效| ExecuteLogin[执行executeLogin]
    
    JWTValid -->|过期 TokenExpiredException| CheckRedis{检查Redis中<br/>是否存在该Token?}
    CheckRedis -->|存在| RefreshToken[自动刷新Token流程]
    CheckRedis -->|不存在| Return401_2[返回401: 令牌已过期]
    
    JWTValid -->|签名异常| Return401_3[返回401: 无效的签名]
    
    RefreshToken --> DeleteOld[删除Redis旧Token]
    DeleteOld --> CreateNew[生成新JWT Token]
    CreateNew --> SaveRedis[存入Redis<br/>key: token, value: userId]
    SaveRedis --> SetThreadLocal[存入ThreadLocal]
    SetThreadLocal --> ExecuteLogin
    
    ExecuteLogin --> RealmAuth[调用OAuth2Realm.doGetAuthenticationInfo]
    
    RealmAuth --> ExtractUserId[从Token中提取userId]
    ExtractUserId --> QueryUser[查询数据库用户信息]
    
    QueryUser --> UserExists{用户是否存在?}
    UserExists -->|不存在| ThrowLocked[抛出LockedAccountException]
    UserExists -->|存在| CreateAuthInfo[创建AuthenticationInfo]
    
    CreateAuthInfo --> AuthSuccess[认证成功]
    
    AuthSuccess --> ControllerAction[进入Controller方法]
    
    ControllerAction --> HasPermission{是否有<br/>@RequiresPermissions注解?}
    HasPermission -->|有| CheckPermission[调用doGetAuthorizationInfo<br/>检查用户权限]
    HasPermission -->|无| ExecuteMethod[执行业务逻辑]
    
    CheckPermission --> PermGranted{权限是否足够?}
    PermGranted -->|是| ExecuteMethod
    PermGranted -->|否| Return403[返回403: 权限不足]
    
    ExecuteMethod --> BuildResponse[构建响应数据]
    BuildResponse --> End([返回结果给客户端])
    
    Return401_1 --> End
    Return401_2 --> End
    Return401_3 --> End
    ThrowLocked --> ErrorHandle[全局异常处理]
    ErrorHandle --> End
    Return403 --> End
    CORSReturn --> End
    AllowAccess --> End
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style End fill:#e1f5ff
    style OAuth2Filter fill:#fff4e6
    style RealmAuth fill:#fff4e6
    style RefreshToken fill:#d4edda
    style ExecuteLogin fill:#d4edda
    style Return401_1 fill:#f8d7da
    style Return401_2 fill:#f8d7da
    style Return401_3 fill:#f8d7da
    style Return403 fill:#f8d7da